# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Deployment Image Servicing and Management tool. DISM is used to enumerate, install, uninstall, configure, and update features and packages in Windows images
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Image="*\\Dism.exe" AND (CommandLine CONTAIN "/Online" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "/Disable-Feature")) OR (Image="*\\DismHost.exe" AND (ParentCommandLine CONTAIN "/Online" AND ParentCommandLine CONTAIN "/Disable-Feature")))
